2_tittenhurst_park_13.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"600,450\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison at The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_13.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>Lennon and Ono then led two donkeys from the nearby stables, and The Beatles posed with them.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/&quot;}' id='gallery-2' class='gallery galleryid-3251 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_14/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQ0IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_14-144x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon and Yoko Ono at The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_14-144x200.jpg 144w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_14-418x580.jpg 418w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_14.jpg 577w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 144px) 100vw, 144px\" data-attachment-id=\"8986\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_14/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_14.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"577,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-ima